<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(ALIBABA STRIKES BACK: QWEN 2.5-MAX CHALLENGES DEEPSEEK AND GPT-4O)/E(ALIBABA STRIKES BACK: QWEN 2.5-MAX CHALLENGES DEEPSEEK AND GPT-4O)/Pg 10 0 R/K[1]/P 97 0 R>>
