228 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(As of 27th February 2025, Open AI has released its latest and most advanced GPT 4.5. Its designed for higher accuracy, less hallucination and a better understanding of people. With improvements in creativity and reasons, GPT-4.5 aims to make AI interaction feel more natural than ever before, but how much of a difference does it actually make?)/Pg 14 0 R/K[6]/P 101 0 R>>
endobj

229 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(THE IMPROVEMENTS:)/E(THE IMPROVEMENTS:)/Pg 14 0 R/K[16]/P 101 0 R>>
endobj

230 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Reduced hallucination rate: GPT-4.5 hallucinates 40% less than its prior 4.o model, allowing for greater accuracy in tasks. )/Pg 14 0 R/K[2]/P 101 0 R>>
endobj

231 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Better user interaction: Increasingly natural conversations with increased emotional intelligence compared to 4o\220s sometimes robotics answers, making the AI feel slightly more human-like. )/Pg 14 0 R/K[3]/P 101 0 R>>
endobj

232 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Increased language support: With 15 languages supported from Chinese to Arabic to Korean, it surpasses previous version in multilingual proficiency )/Pg 14 0 R/K[4]/P 101 0 R>>
endobj

233 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Like prior GPT models, 4.5 remains as an LLM. )/Pg 14 0 R/K[5]/P 101 0 R>>
