endobj

236 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Unsupervised learning: Absorbing information through recognising patterns which allows the AI to understand relationships between concepts and ideas without needing explicit instructions, making it more capable of handling open-ended questions. )/Pg 14 0 R/K[13]/P 101 0 R>>
endobj

237 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Supervised fine-tuning: With researches training GPT-4.5 in examples of correct and incorrect answers which guide answers to more accurate and natural training. )/Pg 14 0 R/K[14]/P 101 0 R>>
endobj

238 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Reinforcement Learning From Human Feedback \(RLHF\): A method of learning where human testers rank AI responses with models being trained to prioritise the most helpful and clear answers. With the API available for develops, GPT 4.5 can be integrated into applications, chatbots and research tools providing increased accuracy and creativity )/Pg 14 0 R/K[15]/P 101 0 R>>
