327 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Concerns have been raised about how this could impact the UK\220s commitment to clean energy production by 2030 which involves \24340 billion per year in private investment in development of renewable energy projects and a transition away from fossil fuels toward a fully clean, homegrown power system including wind, solar, and nuclear energy.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[3]/P 106 0 R>>
endobj

328 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(The problem arises with data centres being notoriously energy hungry with an average one needing between 100-500 million watts, consuming enough to power around 80,000 homes while hyper scale data centres can use up to 1 giga watt, enough to power 800,000 homes. )/Pg 19 0 R/K[4]/P 106 0 R>>
