endobj

430 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(4.\) Lack of interaction and understanding of the real world: AI can process language but can\220t interact directly with the real world, creating a barrier on knowledge and understanding )/Pg 24 0 R/K[19]/P 111 0 R>>
endobj

431 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(These issues are necessary to be solved for AI to progress in more advanced tasks, far more than what its capable of today. LLM\220s in their current stage aren\220t inherently \217bad\220 or \217behind\220, they\220re highly advanced systems but for the next level of real-world tasks are insufficient because of these current limitations. )/Pg 24 0 R/K[20]/P 111 0 R>>
endobj

