474 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(WHAT IS AI ALIGNMENT?)/E(WHAT IS AI ALIGNMENT?)/Pg 26 0 R/K[10]/P 113 0 R>>
endobj

475 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(AI alignment refers to ensuring that AI systems are accurately aligned with human values and intension and that they behave in ways which are trustworthy and accountable. As AI technology becomes more advanced, the focus on addressing a trust gap between humans and AI become more essential to focus on. AIA seeks to ensure that AI systems understand and follow human objectives while avoiding harmful or unintended consequences from fraud to misinformation, allowing transparency and responsibility. Human.org\220s mission is to solve AIA, ensuring this critical issue is resolved as AI advances.)/Pg 26 0 R/K[12]/P 113 0 R>>
endobj

476 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(HOW IS HUMAN.ORG  ACHIEVING THIS?)/E(HOW IS HUMAN.ORG  ACHIEVING THIS?)/Pg 26 0 R/K[13]/P 113 0 R>>
endobj

477 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(1.\) Layer 1 blockchain development )/Pg 26 0 R/K[14]/P 113 0 R>>
endobj

478 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(A decentralised blockchain in this context refers to a system where data is stored across many computers, making manipulation of the data very difficult, needing the approval of the majority of participants in the network. This decentralised system is controlled by no company or government, ensuring its neutrality and trustworthiness.  )/Pg 26 0 R/K[15]/P 113 0 R>>
endobj

