495 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(While the company has introduced a crypto currency, the main goal of human.org remains on solving the AI alignment problem. The introduction of the digital currency Humancoin is a digital currency that is intended to be given to reward verified users that operate within the human blockchain, rewarding this who help users and contribute to verification. )/Pg 27 0 R/K[11]/P 114 0 R>>
