endobj

498 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(As Human.org raises $7.5 million to tackle the pressing challenge of AI alignment, one has to ask: Can a decentralised blockchain really ensure the kind of accountability and trustworthiness needed in an AI-driven future? )/Pg 27 0 R/K[14]/P 114 0 R>>
endobj

499 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(While the promise of solving AI alignment is undoubtedly crucial, the path to achieving it remains riddled with uncertainties and by creating a blockchain-based system that verifies both human and AI identities, Human.org certainly aims to address the core issue of trust between humans and AI. Yet, questions linger about the scalability, real-world application, and true neutrality of such a system in a rapidly evolving technological landscape.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[15]/P 114 0 R>>
endobj

